The test suite (not part of the rsort binary) includes:

- tests/upstream.rs: a port of sort/tests/t_sort.sh from the same
  repository, which comes from NetBSD and is under the NetBSD Foundation's
  2-clause BSD license. Its full notice is at the top of that file.
- tests/upstream/testsuite/sample.txt and bigsample.txt.xz: test inputs from
  sort/testsuite in the same repository (FreeBSD sort's test suite). They
  carry no license notice of their own and are included unchanged.
